Changed: Portable::MatrixFree now stores the indices of degrees of freedom
with Dirichlet constraints (constraints without entries) as
numbers::invalid_unsigned_int, like MatrixFree. Portable::FEEvaluation reads
them as zero in read_dof_values() and skips them in
distribute_local_to_global(), so that the result of a cell loop no longer
depends on the values of the source vector at these degrees of freedom.
<br>
(Ivan Prusak, 2026/11/18)
